// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// PLAYS — the one distinctive piece of play of each of the 25 jobs. 60-120 real seconds, once per worked shift (it replaces
// one ordinary task chain around the middle of the shift). reuses = an existing G.skillplay key or showpiece mechanic the engine
// worker can build on ('new' = a new small mini-game). Every play has an Auto / skip that scores the baseline, as mini-games do.
//   good / bad = what a strong and a weak result look like to the player.   pays = what a good result adds on top of the shift.
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
